{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1040323-resources-in-storypath","id":1040323,"title":"Resources in Storypath","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-29T17:55:32-08:00","id":1040323,"title":"Resources in Storypath","content":"I'm sorry if I missed this somewhere, but I am curious as to how Storypath will handle money and resources. Will it be the same as CofD does it, with Edges and equipment bonuses?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T17:57:52-08:00","id":1040324,"title":"","content":"Not in Scion.. <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Evoking the Path</span></span></b><br /><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Being on a Path confers certain benefits: a cop or criminal can get small arms and ammunition for free, for example, or allow access to restricted areas (the police station or a nightclub known to be a mob hangout), and a one-percenter can make wild purchases with abandon. The rule of thumb is: </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><i><span style=\"font-size:16px\">if someone on the Path would reasonably have this item, or access, or capability, your character has it</span></i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">. If the character wants or needs more, they need to evoke their Path.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Evoking just means calling out a Path applicable to the situation and describing the effects. A Path may only be evoked once per session; place a check in the box next to the Path and erase it after the session is over. Evocation grants access to one of the following effects:</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Resources:</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> A Path indicates an entire ecosystem of resources and relationships. So long as you\u2019re in good standing with what your Path represents, you can draw on it for aid above and beyond what you\u2019re entitled to, be it backup, equipment, access, or protection. This can be in the form of temporary Followers, </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><i><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Danielle\u2019s character Tysha is a cop, with the Path of \u201cNew York\u2019s Finest\u201d. She can arrest other characters with probable cause, use deadly force, or generally do anything a cop can. To request backup (in the form of temporary Followers) or obtain a search warrant to raid a rival Scion\u2019s premises, she evokes this Path. </span></i></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-29T18:00:55-08:00","id":1040328,"title":"","content":"Stellar, sir. Thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}